  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2132\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_81smallstars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150810065423\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 81smallstars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_81smallstars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2128\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2128\">2128</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 4, 2132</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2136\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2136\">2136</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All eligible voters who turned out</small><br /><small>51% of votes votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">80.9%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/89/Halvidar_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20151024200819\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Halvidar Blank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/89/Halvidar_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151024200819\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Halvidar Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Halvidar_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/18/David_Castillo_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20151103015640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"David Castillo Blank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/18/David_Castillo_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151103015640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"David Castillo Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"David_Castillo_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/David_Castillo\" title=\"David Castillo\">David Castillo</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Union Party\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Dignidad\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mars\" title=\"Mars\">Bradbury Territory</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Nevada</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">Cora Fabian</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Carlos Salazar\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>129,783,825</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">60,219,694\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>37.5%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">17.4%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Mike Jacobi\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Lydia Monroe\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative Union\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Ontario</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">New York</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Sarima Haden\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Harrison Reed\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">41,876,914\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">94,482,625\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">12.1%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">27.3%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Thang_Levin\" title=\"Thang Levin\">Thang Levin</a><br />\nConservative\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2132</b> was the 87th quadrennial presidential election. The election was held on Tuesday, November 4, 2132 and served as the immediate impetus for the outbreak of the Second American Civil War. The United States had been divided during the majority of the early 22nd Century on questions surrounding the status of the Southwest of the North American continent. By 2132, the alliance between the Conservative and Dignidad Parties had crumbled. In the face of a divided opposition, the new Union Party, originally from the Colonies, secured a plurality of the vote, putting Lionel \"Leo\" Halvidar in the White House with almost no support from the Southwest.\n</p><p>Before Halvidar's inauguration, four Southwestern states declared their secession and later formed the United States of Aztlan. Secessionists from three additional Border states called to join them when Halvidar's call to restore federal property in the South forced them to take sides, while Utah and Colorado attempted to remain neutral. At the 2136 election, the Union had admitted Oklahoma, Jacinto and Brazos as free-soil states.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Nominations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nominations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Conservative_Party\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Conservative Party</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Progressive_Party\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Progressive Party</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dignidad_Para_La_Raza_Party\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dignidad Para La Raza Party</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Union_Party\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Union Party</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Green_Party\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Green Party</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Constitution_Party\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Constitution Party</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Campaign\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Campaign</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nominations\">Nominations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conservative_Party\">Conservative Party</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Lydia Monroe</b> Former Senator from New York</li>\n<li><b>Harrison Reed</b> U.S. Senator from Victoria</li>\n<li><b>Dan Jagan</b> Congressman from Guyana</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Progressive_Party\">Progressive Party</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Mike Jacobi</b> Governor of Ontario</li>\n<li><b>Sarima Haden</b> U.S. Senator from Michigan</li>\n<li><b>Alice Turner</b> Congresswoman from England</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dignidad_Para_La_Raza_Party\">Dignidad Para La Raza Party</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>David Castillo</b> Former Vice President of the United States</li>\n<li><b>Carlos Salazar</b> U.S. Senator from Texas</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Union_Party\">Union Party</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Lionel Halvidar</b> ITC Chairman and former Resident Commissioner of Bradbury</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Green_Party\">Green Party</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Sofia Lamothe</b> Congresswoman from Hispaniola</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Constitution_Party\">Constitution Party</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Frank Blithe</b> Congressman from Oregon</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Campaign\">Campaign</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2132%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The contest in the Southwest was between David Castillo and Lydia Monroe, while Halvidar and Jacobi fought primarily for the rest of the country, with both candidates even making tours into the Southwest. Halvidar's name wasn't even on the ballot in Arizona and New Mexico. Three debates were scheduled for all six of the major candidates, along with the seven public one-on-ones challanged between individual candidates, the most significant being the debate between Castillo and Halvidar in October 3rd, 2132.\n</p><p>Halvidar focused much of the campaign calling for greater national unity through econoimc and constitutional reforms that had been in use in the colonies for the last five decades. Halvidar's economic reforms resonated with the majority of the country's electorate.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205507\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.099 sec